# Shared Test IDs

All `data-testid` values live in [`src/lib/test-ids.ts`](src/lib/test-ids.ts). Use the same constant in product UI and in Vitest/Playwright so selectors never drift.

## Prefer

- Define new ids on `TEST_ID` in `src/lib/test-ids.ts`
- JSX: `data-testid={TEST_ID.contentBlock}`
- Tests: `getByTestId(TEST_ID.contentBlock)`, `getAllByTestId(TEST_ID.…)`
- CSS attribute / `querySelector` / Playwright locators: `testIdSelector(TEST_ID.contentBlock)`
- Slot mocks: `componentSlotTestId("main")` (keep mock `slot-${region}` in sync with that helper)

## Do not

- Hardcode the same string in JSX and again in a test (`data-testid="content-block"` + `getByTestId("content-block")`)
- Invent one-off `data-testid` literals without adding them to `TEST_ID`
- Use `data-testid` in CSS (see simple-css-selectors rule)

## Playwright `evaluate` / `evaluateAll`

Callbacks run in the browser and cannot close over Node imports. Pass selector strings as arguments:

```ts
await unit.evaluate(
  (el, sel) => el.querySelector(sel),
  testIdSelector(TEST_ID.contentBlock)
);
```

## Imports

- App / unit tests: `import { TEST_ID, testIdSelector } from "@/lib/test-ids"`
- E2E: `import { TEST_ID, testIdSelector } from "../src/lib/test-ids"`
